# style=auto at a touch viewport is genuine autocast, not the desktop
# fallback-to-good. The Long Cold is README's own "hardest single cell" and
# docs/upkeep.md's `raid / drive` table gives it the second-widest
# played-vs-idle gap of all eleven fights (57% vs 2%, +55) -- so a tank under
# real autocast on the hardest fight, with FALTERING cutting every heal
# (including the AI healers' own heals landing on this tank) by a quarter, is
# the sharpest test yet of whether autocast actually holds up a tank's own
# survival on the one fight the hand-played policy struggles hardest to win.
